request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true.

governor turn 1: plan -> types, commands  (The request maps to the existing Todo.done field (the codebase's completion flag). Two units must change in lockstep: types gains a "clear" Command variant, and commands implements clear() (filter out done todos), parses "clear" from argv, and wires it into run() with load/save persistence. storage and format are unaffected.)
round 1: owners types=ok commands=ok; oracle GREEN
governor turn 2: accept  (Oracle is green (tsc clean, 20/20 tests pass) and the acceptance tests confirm the request: clear removes todos with done === true, parseArgs handles "clear", and run persists the filtered list and returns output. The request is satisfied.)

